<title>UK: LucasVarity confirms share buy from Hoare.</title>
<headline>LucasVarity confirms share buy from Hoare.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-American engineering group LucasVarity Plc confirmed on Thursday that it bought 10 million shares of its own shares for cancellation today at 198p per share.</p>
<p>It bought the shares, representing 0.7 percent of the company's current share capital, from ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
